  "content": {
    "equation": "Infuse Rate:\nIf Concentration = anything except “Other”:\nInfuse Rate = (Dose * Weight * 60) / Concentration\n• Infuse Rate is calculated in mL/hour\n• Dose is input in mcg/kg/minute\n• Weight is input in kg\n• Concentration is input in mcg/mL\nIf Concentration = “Other”:\nInfuse Rate = [(Dose * Weight) * 60] / [(Drug Amount / Infusate Volume) * 1000]\n• Infuse Rate is calculated in mL/hour\n• Dose is input in mcg/kg/minute\n• Weight is input in kg\n• Weight is input in kg\n• Drug Amount is input in mg\n• Infusate Volume is input in mL",
